Package: duplicut
Version: 2.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, tar, gzip, make, clang, binutils
Section: cracking
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/nil0x42/duplicut
Description: Fast duplicate line remover for wordlists
 duplicut removes duplicate lines from massive wordlists in O(1)
 without sorting, using a hash map built on legacy brute-force
 memory. Ideal for cleaning huge password dictionaries.
